===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Morpeko}} in its {{form|Morpeko|Hangry Mode}}.
*Both of this card's illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Morpeko|121}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion, as did its '''Energizer Wheel''' attack.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

